NOTE ON CONTENT: this package describes an unbuilt game. It contains no game
code, no engine, and no third-party game assets. It cites public reviews and
vendor documentation by link only. "Mobile Forces" is used to identify the
original 2002 game as a design reference; no affiliation or endorsement is
claimed, and no original assets, geometry, or trademarks are reproduced.
